[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-7
TITLE: SpeedController module (Simulink MBD generated)
STATEMENT: >>>
The ``speed_controller`` C module implements REQ-7. It is generated from
a Simulink model (see models/speed_controller.md) with Simulink Embedded
Coder and must not be hand-edited; regenerating it from the model is the
only supported way to change its behavior. Because of that, this
relation links directly to the generated files themselves (``TYPE: File``)
instead of relying on an in-file ``@relation(...)`` marker, which is how
the other six (hand-written) modules are linked.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-7
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: src/speed_controller/speed_controller.c
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: src/speed_controller/speed_controller.h
